---@field columns? gcp.bigquery_v2.BigtableColumnList Optional. Lists of columns that should be exposed as individual fields as opposed to a list of (column name, value) pairs. All columns whose qualifier matches a qualifier in this list can be accessed as `.`. Other columns can be accessed as a list through the `.Column` field.

