---@field useInt64Timestamp? boolean Optional. Output timestamp as usec int64. Default is false.
---@field timestampOutputFormat? gcp.bigquery_v2.DataFormatOptionsTimestampOutputFormatEnum|string Optional. The API output format for a timestamp. This offers more explicit control over the timestamp output format as compared to the existing `use_int64_timestamp` option.

