---@field colsampleBytree? gcp.bigquery_v2.DoubleHparamSearchSpace Subsample ratio of columns when constructing each tree for boosted tree models.
---@field numClusters? gcp.bigquery_v2.IntHparamSearchSpace Number of clusters for k-means.
---@field dropout? gcp.bigquery_v2.DoubleHparamSearchSpace Dropout probability for dnn model training and boosted tree models using dart booster.
---@field colsampleBylevel? gcp.bigquery_v2.DoubleHparamSearchSpace Subsample ratio of columns for each level for boosted tree models.
---@field hiddenUnits? gcp.bigquery_v2.IntArrayHparamSearchSpace Hidden units for neural network models.
---@field l1Reg? gcp.bigquery_v2.DoubleHparamSearchSpace L1 regularization coefficient.
---@field boosterType? gcp.bigquery_v2.StringHparamSearchSpace Booster type for boosted tree models.
---@field numParallelTree? gcp.bigquery_v2.IntHparamSearchSpace Number of parallel trees for boosted tree models.
---@field learnRate? gcp.bigquery_v2.DoubleHparamSearchSpace Learning rate of training jobs.
---@field subsample? gcp.bigquery_v2.DoubleHparamSearchSpace Subsample the training data to grow tree to prevent overfitting for boosted tree models.
---@field dartNormalizeType? gcp.bigquery_v2.StringHparamSearchSpace Dart normalization type for boosted tree models.
---@field minTreeChildWeight? gcp.bigquery_v2.IntHparamSearchSpace Minimum sum of instance weight needed in a child for boosted tree models.
---@field l2Reg? gcp.bigquery_v2.DoubleHparamSearchSpace L2 regularization coefficient.
---@field batchSize? gcp.bigquery_v2.IntHparamSearchSpace Mini batch sample size.
---@field colsampleBynode? gcp.bigquery_v2.DoubleHparamSearchSpace Subsample ratio of columns for each node(split) for boosted tree models.
---@field walsAlpha? gcp.bigquery_v2.DoubleHparamSearchSpace Hyperparameter for matrix factoration when implicit feedback type is specified.
---@field treeMethod? gcp.bigquery_v2.StringHparamSearchSpace Tree construction algorithm for boosted tree models.
---@field maxTreeDepth? gcp.bigquery_v2.IntHparamSearchSpace Maximum depth of a tree for boosted tree models.
---@field numFactors? gcp.bigquery_v2.IntHparamSearchSpace Number of latent factors to train on.

