---@field vectorSearchStatistics? gcp.bigquery_v2.VectorSearchStatistics Output only. Vector Search query specific statistics.
---@field undeclaredQueryParameters? gcp.bigquery_v2.QueryParameterList Output only. GoogleSQL only: list of undeclared query parameters detected during a dry run validation.
---@field materializedViewStatistics? gcp.bigquery_v2.MaterializedViewStatistics Output only. Statistics of materialized views of a query job.
---@field performanceInsights? gcp.bigquery_v2.PerformanceInsights Output only. Performance insights.
---@field metadataCacheStatistics? gcp.bigquery_v2.MetadataCacheStatistics Output only. Statistics of metadata cache usage in a query for BigLake tables.
---@field totalPartitionsProcessed? string Output only. Total number of partitions processed from all partitioned tables referenced in the job.
---@field schema? gcp.bigquery_v2.TableSchema Output only. The schema of the results. Present only for successful dry run of non-legacy SQL queries.
---@field totalBytesProcessedAccuracy? string Output only. For dry-run jobs, totalBytesProcessed is an estimate and this field specifies the accuracy of the estimate. Possible values can be: UNKNOWN: accuracy of the estimate is unknown. PRECISE: estimate is precise. LOWER_BOUND: estimate is lower bound of what the query would cost. UPPER_BOUND: estimate is upper bound of what the query would cost.
