---@class gcp.bigquery_v2.RowAccessPolicyReference
---@field tableId? string Required. The ID of the table containing this row access policy.
---@field datasetId? string Required. The ID of the dataset containing this row access policy.
---@field policyId? string Required. The ID of the row access policy. The ID must contain only letters (a-z, A-Z), numbers (0-9), or underscores (_). The maximum length is 256 characters.
---@field projectId? string Required. The ID of the project containing this row access policy.

