---@field indexPruningStats? gcp.bigquery_v2.IndexPruningStatsList Search index pruning statistics, one for each base table that has a search index. If a base table does not have a search index or the index does not help with pruning on the base table, then there is no pruning statistics for that table.
---@field indexUsageMode? gcp.bigquery_v2.SearchStatisticsIndexUsageModeEnum|string Specifies the index usage mode for the query.

