---Information about a single training query run for the model.
---@class gcp.bigquery_v2.TrainingRun
---@field dataSplitResult? gcp.bigquery_v2.DataSplitResult Output only. Data split result of the training run. Only set when the input data is actually split.
---@field results? gcp.bigquery_v2.IterationResultList Output only. Output of each iteration run, results.size() <= max_iterations.
---@field vertexAiModelVersion? string Output only. The model version in the [Vertex AI Model Registry](https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/docs/model-registry/introduction) for this training run.
---@field vertexAiModelId? string The model id in the [Vertex AI Model Registry](https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/docs/model-registry/introduction) for this training run.
---@field trainingOptions? gcp.bigquery_v2.TrainingOptions Output only. Options that were used for this training run, includes user specified and default options that were used.
---@field startTime? string Output only. The start time of this training run.
---@field trainingStartTime? string Output only. The start time of this training run, in milliseconds since epoch.
---@field classLevelGlobalExplanations? gcp.bigquery_v2.GlobalExplanationList Output only. Global explanation contains the explanation of top features on the class level. Applies to classification models only.
---@field evaluationMetrics? gcp.bigquery_v2.EvaluationMetrics Output only. The evaluation metrics over training/eval data that were computed at the end of training.
---@field modelLevelGlobalExplanation? gcp.bigquery_v2.GlobalExplanation Output only. Global explanation contains the explanation of top features on the model level. Applies to both regression and classification models.

---@alias gcp.bigquery_v2.TrainingRunList gcp.bigquery_v2.TrainingRun[]

